entry.summary:
No Framework, No Pain: Writing Aether Slices


The previous article introduced Aether's philosophy: return Java to managed runtimes, let the runtime handle infrastructure, let developers handle business logic. This article shows what that looks like in practice -- what you actually write, how dependencies work, how testing works, and how existing code migrates in.
Here's an entire deployable service:
@Slice
public interface OrderService {
    Promise<OrderResult> placeOrder(PlaceOrderRequest request);

    static OrderService orderService(InventoryService inventory,
                                     PricingEngine pricing) {
